{"overview":"وقتی ریک، خواننده عروسی که دیگر در اوج توان نیست، در یک اجرا با دنی، ستارهٔ کم‌رنگ باند پسرانه، آشنا می‌شود، دو نفر از طریق موسیقی و یک جلسهٔ جَم شبانه به هم نزدیک می‌شوند. اما وقتی دنی یکی از آهنگ‌های ریک را به هیتی تبدیل می‌کند که کار او را دوباره زنده می‌کند، ریک برای بازپس‌گیری شناختی که شایسته‌اش می‌داند، حتی اگر به خطر بیندازد همهٔ آنچه برایش مهم است، می‌کوشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When Rick, a past-his-prime wedding singer, meets fading boy-band star Danny during a gig, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But when Danny turns one of Rick’s songs into the hit that reignites his career, Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves - even if it means risking everything he cares about.","tagline_en":"It's time to set the record straight.","runtime":99,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["جان کارنی"],"crew_en":["John Carney"],"countries":["IE","US"],"cast":[{"name":"پاول راد","role":"Rick","photo":"/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg","en":"Paul Rudd"},{"name":"Nick Jonas","role":"Danny Wilson","photo":"/y79k7wrDeyRbrGFs2Z3XHU5mq0o.jpg"},{"name":"Peter McDonald","role":"Sandy","photo":"/ahacAWWP4zzuVumOUB8hZoJcHTA.jpg"},{"name":"Marcella Plunkett","role":"Rachel","photo":"/ieeuGpDxOQMvSzNYehDZT7FMCLR.jpg"},{"name":"هاوانا رز لیو","role":"Marcia","photo":"/xt5jIhVekKpwZDbVuHJb8H4A6oM.jpg","en":"Havana Rose Liu"},{"name":"جک رینور","role":"Mac","photo":"/vbPewOkSGGQl93wgshDlczMqiOk.jpg","en":"Jack Reynor"},{"name":"Rory Keenan","role":"Binzer","photo":"/coxaroBNEpi4xjQ7kZuZBxSqO29.jpg"},{"name":"Keith McErlean","role":"Kyle","photo":"/rkSrF2jGZRIt4iwS1qIB967mTM4.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Reid","role":"Bernie","photo":"/j94PrRDF1bZQ4fDE4y8NaxIPVt.jpg"},{"name":"Beth Fallon","role":"Aja","photo":"/crbLmf1TAP7qvm8mTGJZpyv8VMz.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Rose Creaner","role":"Claire","photo":"/9AkMDdOgOYph3SqHKnDI1okA9if.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Mitchell","role":"George","photo":"/6fNnCVAYIRI2Tyk6WfcWQYMERwF.jpg